<title>RUSSIA: Russia Izhorskiye Zavody sets 20,040 rbls dividend.</title>
<headline>Russia Izhorskiye Zavody sets 20,040 rbls dividend.</headline>
<dateline>ST PETERSBURG, Russia 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>				   1996		 1995</p>
<p>    Net profit		 70.0 bln rbls    99.0 bln rbls</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	  111.0 bln	  190.0 bln</p>
<p>    Turnover		1.368,0 trln    1.073,0 trln</p>
<p>Dividend</p>
<p>    ordinary			0		   0</p>
<p>    preferred		  20,040 rbls    2,826 rbls</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name AO Izhorskiye Zavody.</p>
<p>In 1996 the company changed the face value of its shares to 400,000 roubles from 1,000 roubles.</p>
<p>Its main shareholders are employees with 22 percent of shares, AO Lenstroiinvestmenedzhment with 12 percent, AO Pioner with 13.9 percent.</p>
<p>It produces rolled metal and machinery.</p>
<p>--St Petersburg Newsroom, +7812 219 9209</p>
